  "worked_solution": "Starting with the initial terms ${a}_{1}=2,$ and ${a}_{2}=4,$ we compute the next terms using the recursive formula until we reach the fourth term.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =2 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =4 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =3{a}_{2}+2{a}_{1}=3\\cdot 4+2\\cdot 2=12+4=16 \\\\ {a}_{4} & =3{a}_{3}+2{a}_{2}=3\\cdot 16+2\\cdot 4=48+8=56\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the fourth term is ${a}_{4}=56.$",
